  "t1": 2.5,
  "tipo": "imagen",
  "texto": "You flush a spider. Whoosh."
 },
 {
  "id": "scene-002",
  "t0": 2.5,
  "t1": 5.176,
  "tipo": "imagen",
  "texto": "Gone. But where does"
 },
 {
  "id": "scene-003",
  "t0": 5.176,
  "t1": 7.556,
  "tipo": "imagen",
  "texto": "it actually go? And can it come back"
 },
 {
  "id": "scene-004",
  "t0": 7.556,
  "t1": 9.424,
  "tipo": "imagen",
  "texto": "up?"
 },
 {
  "id": "scene-005",
  "t0": 9.424,
  "t1": 12.274,
  "tipo": "imagen",
  "texto": "First, it shoots through the toilet's water trap."
 },
 {
  "id": "scene-006",
  "t0": 12.274,
  "t1": 16.419,
  "tipo": "imagen",
  "texto": "The biggest water slide on Earth, in total darkness."
 },
 {
  "id": "scene-007",
  "t0": 16.419,
  "t1": 18.019,
  "tipo": "imagen",
  "texto": "Tiny water-repelling hairs"
 },
 {
  "id": "scene-008",
  "t0": 18.019,
  "t1": 20.499,
  "tipo": "imagen",
  "texto": "wrap it in a bubble of air, so"
 },
 {
  "id": "scene-009",
  "t0": 20.499,
  "t1": 22.86,
  "tipo": "imagen",
  "texto": "it can float."
 },
 {
  "id": "scene-010",
  "t0": 22.86,
  "t1": 25.76,
  "tipo": "imagen",
  "texto": "And drowning is slow. Scientists"
 },
 {
  "id": "scene-011",
  "t0": 25.76,
  "t1": 28.88,
  "tipo": "imagen",
  "texto": "kept spiders underwater for sixteen hours."
 },
 {
  "id": "scene-012",
  "t0": 28.88,
  "t1": 31.133,
  "tipo": "imagen",
  "texto": "They looked dead."
 },
 {
  "id": "scene-013",
  "t0": 31.133,
  "t1": 33.113,
  "tipo": "imagen",
  "texto": "Then they dried off, and walked"
 },
 {
  "id": "scene-014",
  "t0": 33.113,
  "t1": 36.213,
  "tipo": "imagen",
  "texto": "away. Can it climb back up?"
 },
 {
  "id": "scene-015",
  "t0": 36.213,
  "t1": 38.113,
  "tipo": "imagen",
  "texto": "Almost certainly not."
 },
 {
  "id": "scene-016",
  "t0": 38.113,
  "t1": 40.552,
  "tipo": "imagen",
  "texto": "The water in the trap stops it."
 },
 {
  "id": "scene-017",
  "t0": 40.552,
  "t1": 43.872,
  "tipo": "imagen",
  "texto": "So next time, skip the flush. A cup and"
 },
 {
  "id": "scene-018",
  "t0": 43.872,
  "t1": 46.5,
  "tipo": "imagen",
  "texto": "a piece of paper does the job."
 }
]